Z||000006||MinnGreenGT||12-07-2001||05:07 PM||||You could also register your own domain name for $15 per year at <A HREF="http://www.directnic.com" TARGET=_blank>http://www.directnic.com</A>    they offer 15MB free hosting and mail forwarding...it's another $15 per year if you don't want their banner on your site.  So $30 per year is pretty good- it covers all your normal charges for owning the domain name too.<P>------------------<BR>              <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/GreenGT6.gif"> ||||reg||1
Z||000007||Tigger||12-07-2001||06:15 PM||||Check out <A HREF="http://www.envy.nu" TARGET=_blank>http://www.envy.nu</A> <P>Free 20mb, no banners, no pop-ups, no-nonsense.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>I just moved my site from fortunecity.com over to there a couple weeks ago to get rid of the annoying banners and pop-ups.  So far it's been great!  When you get your site up and running be sure to let us know so we can add a link to our pages.<P>------------------<BR>         <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/tiggerblue4.gif">         <BR>T-T-F-N, Ta Ta For Now!<BR><A HREF="http://www.envy.nu/fiero/" TARGET=_blank>Tigger's Fiero Page</A>||||reg||1
